<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Unocal Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Unocal Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Morgan Stanley analyst Doug Terreson Thursday kept his fourth quarter estimates for Unocal Corp unchanged at $0.60 a share.</p>
<p>- Cited higher profits for crude oil and natural gas offset by falling earnings in the downsteam sector.</p>
<p>- Noted downstream operations, which includes refining and marketing, softened because of intense competition in California markets.</p>
<p>- Forecast annual earnings for 1996 at $2.45/share versus $1.07/share for 1995.</p>
</text>
